<section class="philosophy" id="about">
  <div class="section-inner philosophy-inner">
    <p class="philosophy-label">Our Training Philosophy</p>

    <h2>Confidence Built Through Practice.</h2>

    <p class="philosophy-intro">
      Our goal is not simply to help students earn a certification. We help
      people develop the practical skills, judgment, and confidence to respond
      effectively when real emergencies do not follow the script.
    </p>

    <div class="philosophy-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>Master the Fundamentals</h3>
        <p>
          Strong performance begins with understanding and consistently
          performing the basic skills well.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Understand, Not Memorize</h3>
        <p>
          Complex medical concepts are broken down into clear, understandable
          lessons that students can apply in real situations.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Adapt to the Unexpected</h3>
        <p>
          Hands-on practice and realistic scenarios build the ability to think
          critically, adapt, and respond with confidence.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
